#: kwlansuprocess.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>Kwlan was unable to<p align=\"center\"><b>%1</b></p>This may be caused "
"by temporary malfunction or system misconfiguration (e.g. absence of the "
"utility called). You may want to run this task again and see if this helps. "
"Do you want to restart the task?</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dat <p align=\"center\"><b>%1</b> weer Kwlan nich mööglich.</p>Dat mag "
"an en Fehler liggen, de wedder weggeiht, oder an en leeg Systeeminrichten "
"(dat opropen Programm is gor nich installeert, a.B.). Probeer dat man un "
"föhr den Befehl nochmaal ut, villicht hölpt dat jo al. Wullt Du den Befehl "
"nochmaak opropen? </qt>"

#: kwlansuprocess.cpp:86 kwlansuprocess.cpp:110
